{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d33f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0777b-0bfc-71c2-a449-63245f4fe13c"},"sequence":2042,"recorded_at":1780531400004079,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"32f7efe8-067d-4d98-a2af-fff5c474ce56","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"32f7efe8-067d-4d98-a2af-fff5c474ce56","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"32f7efe8-067d-4d98-a2af-fff5c474ce56"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"b23ad6b3-ce5d-42bb-852a-fa263aaafdc5"},"task_id":"b23ad6b3-ce5d-42bb-852a-fa263aaafdc5","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"b23ad6b3-ce5d-42bb-852a-fa263aaafdc5","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-71-1\",\n  \"command\": \"head -n 60 LOGBOOK.md; echo ...; git diff --stat LOGBOOK.md README.md | cat\",\n  \"description\": \"Check logbook format\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"# Flight Logbook\\n\\n> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\\n> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\\n\\n## 2026-09-06\\n\\n### 1939 — secprim round-3 rework: C1 handle binding, C2 classify-before-close, C3 spelling bound, N24 restored\\n- SCOPE: TASK-260830-2ciy0s round-3 (review-verdict-rev2, C1–C4 blocking). Production: `internal/secprim/nofollow.go` (`guardRootMatches` fstat dev/ino compare via `os.SameFile`, new `guard root mismatch` site in `Guard.Open`); `open_member_unix.go` (classify-before-close at both sites); spelling bound stated in `errors.go`/`inventory_test.go`/README + `TestRefusalInventorySpellingBoundIsStated`; honest reparse mapping in both windows files + README. Tests: `guard_root_test.go` (foreign-handle refusal + matched control, cross-platform), depth-3/4 full-string vectors in `open_unix_test.go`.\\n- ROOT CAUSE (C1): `openCommitRelative(root, _ string, ...)` discarded `guard.root`; unix walked the handle, Windows the path — one entry, two containment roots. Fixed in